ading-title elementor-size-default\">NZ$ 4.99 / yr</p>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e4a924 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6e4a924\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Previously 15.99</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2da6397 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"2da6397\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-float\" href=\"https://my.webhosting.co.nz/index.php?rp=/domain/pricing\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-arrow-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M190.5 66.9l22.2-22.2c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0L441 239c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L246.6 467.3c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.2-22.2c-9.5-9.5-9.3-25 .4-34.3L311.4 296H24c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-32c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h287.4L190.9 101.2c-9.8-9.3-10-24.8-.4-34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">All Domain Names</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57ad5d4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"57ad5d4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21050b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"21050b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\">    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n\n        .whnzd2-wrap, .whnzd2-wrap * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        .whnzd2-wrap {\n            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n            color: #0a0f1e;\n            background: #ffffff;\n            overflow: clip; \n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SCROLL ANIMATIONS \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-animate {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(40px);\n            transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n        }\n        .whnzd2-animate.whnzd2-visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0);\n        }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 INCREASED UNIFORM SECTION GAPS \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 80px 40px; /* Increased from 50px to 80px for larger gaps */\n        }\n        \n        .whnzd2-container:first-of-type {\n            padding-top: 30px; /* Keeps the first section reasonably close to the hero */\n        }\n        \n        .whnzd2-container:last-of-type {\n            padding-bottom: 120px; /* Extra breathing room at the bottom of the page */\n        }\n\n        h2, h3, h4 {\n            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n            color: #0a0f1e;\n        }\n\n        p { color: #5a6478; }\n\n        .whnzd2-center-head {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-center-head h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 40px); margin-bottom: 15px; }\n        .whnzd2-center-head p { font-size: 16px; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 BUTTONS \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-btn {\n            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            text-decoration: none !important;\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-btn-cyan {\n            background: #0CC0DF; color: #ffffff !important; border: 2px solid #0CC0DF;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(12, 192, 223, 0.3);\n        }\n        .whnzd2-btn-cyan:hover { background: #09aecb; border-color: #09aecb; transform: translateY(-2px); }\n        \n        .whnzd2-btn-outline {\n            background: transparent; color: #0CC0DF !important; border: 2px solid #0CC0DF;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-btn-outline:hover { background: #0CC0DF; color: #ffffff !important; transform: translateY(-2px); }\n\n        .whnzd2-btn-white {\n            background: #ffffff; color: #0CC0DF !important; border: 2px solid #ffffff;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }\n        .whnzd2-btn-white:hover { background: #f0f0f0; border-color: #f0f0f0; transform: translateY(-2px); }\n\n        .whnzd2-btn-outline-white {\n            background: transparent; color: #ffffff !important; border: 2px solid #ffffff;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-btn-outline-white:hover { background: #ffffff; color: #0CC0DF !important; transform: translateY(-2px); }\n\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SECTION 1: UNDERSTANDING DOMAINS \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-grid-2 {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 50px;\n            align-items: stretch;\n        }\n        \n        /* Equal Height Flexbox Fix */\n        .whnzd2-s1-left {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n        \n        .whnzd2-s1-text {\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        \n        .whnzd2-s1-text h2 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .whnzd2-s1-text p { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 0; }\n        \n        .whnzd2-cyan-card {\n            background: #0CC0DF;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 30px;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            flex-grow: 1; /* Forces the card to stretch and fill remaining height */\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: center;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(12, 192, 223, 0.15);\n        }\n        .whnzd2-cyan-card h4 {\n            color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-cyan-card h4 svg { stroke: #ffffff; width: 20px; height: 20px; }\n        .whnzd2-cyan-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.7; }\n\n        .whnzd2-s1-right {\n            background: #f8fbff;\n            border: 1px solid #eaedf3;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 40px;\n            height: 100%;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-s1-right h3 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 25px; }\n        .whnzd2-num-list { list-style: none; }\n        .whnzd2-num-list li {\n            display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-num-circle {\n            width: 26px; height: 26px; background: #0CC0DF; color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-num-content strong { color: #0a0f1e; display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n        .whnzd2-num-content span { color: #5a6478; font-size: 13.5px; display: block; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SECTION 2: REGISTER/TRANSFER/RENEW \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-grid-3 {\n            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-action-card {\n            background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #eaedf3; border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 40px 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\n            display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-action-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(12, 192, 223, 0.08); border-color: rgba(12, 192, 223, 0.3); }\n        .whnzd2-action-card h3 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n        .whnzd2-action-card p { font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.6; }\n        .whnzd2-checklist { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n        .whnzd2-checklist li {\n            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #5a6478;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-checklist li svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; stroke: #0CC0DF; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .whnzd2-action-card .whnzd2-btn { width: 100%; margin-top: auto; }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SECTION 3: HOST WITH CONFIDENCE \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-feature-row {\n            display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-feature-ico {\n            width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #f0fcfd; border: 1px solid #e0f8fa;\n            border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-feature-ico svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; stroke: #0CC0DF; fill: none; }\n        .whnzd2-feature-text h4 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n        .whnzd2-feature-text p { font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n        .whnzd2-cyan-card-checklist { list-style: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 25px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }\n        .whnzd2-cyan-card-checklist li {\n            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #ffffff;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-cyan-card-checklist li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n        .whnzd2-cyan-card-checklist li svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; stroke: #ffffff; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SECTION 4: EMAIL & TOOLS \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-tool-card {\n            background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #eaedf3; border-radius: 16px;\n            padding: 40px 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-tool-ico {\n            width: 54px; height: 54px; background: #0CC0DF; border-radius: 14px;\n            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-tool-ico svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; stroke: #ffffff; fill: none; }\n        .whnzd2-tool-card h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n        .whnzd2-tool-card p { font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.6; }\n        .whnzd2-text-link {\n            color: #0CC0DF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;\n            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: auto; transition: transform 0.3s;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-text-link:hover { transform: translateX(4px); }\n        .whnzd2-text-link svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }\n\n        .whnzd2-bottom-banner {\n            background: #0CC0DF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(12, 192, 223, 0.15);\n        }\n        .whnzd2-bottom-banner h3 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n        .whnzd2-bottom-banner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); font-size: 15px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SECTION 5: LOW COST GRID \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-feat-grid {\n            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-feat-box {\n            background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #eaedf3; border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.01);\n        }\n        .whnzd2-feat-box h4 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n        .whnzd2-feat-box p { font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SECTION 6: CYAN CTA BANNER \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-cta-banner {\n            background: #0CC0DF; padding: 100px 40px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-cta-banner h2 { color: #ffffff; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px); margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .whnzd2-cta-banner p { color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 40px; opacity: 0.95; line-height: 1.7; }\n        .whnzd2-cta-buttons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 SECTION 7: FAQS \u2500\u2500 */\n        .whnzd2-faq-wrap { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }\n        .whnzd2-faq-item {\n            background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #eaedf3; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 15px;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-faq-item summary {\n            padding: 25px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; color: #0a0f1e;\n            cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\n        }\n        .whnzd2-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n        .whnzd2-faq-item summary svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; stroke: #0CC0DF; flex-shrink: 0; }\n        .whnzd2-faq-content {\n            padding: 0 25px 25px 57px; color: #5a6478; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n\n        /* \u2500\u2500 RESPONSIVE \u2500\u2500 */\n        @media (max-width: 900px) {\n            .whnzd2-grid-2, .whnzd2-grid-3, .whnzd2-feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .whnzd2-container { padding: 60px 20px; }\n            .whnzd2-cta-banner { padding: 60px 20px; }\n            .whnzd2-faq-content { padding: 0 25px 25px 25px; } \n        }\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            .whnzd2-cta-buttons { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; }\n            .whnzd2-cta-buttons .whnzd2-btn { width: 100%; }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <div class=\"whnzd2-wrap\">\n\n        <section class=\"whnzd2-container whnzd2-grid-2\">\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-s1-left whnzd2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-s1-text\">\n                    <h2>Understanding Domain Extensions and Top-Level Domains</h2>\n                    <p>A domain extension \u2014 also called a top-level domain or TLD \u2014 is the suffix at the end of a web address (such as .co.nz, .com, or .org). Choosing the right extension matters for your brand credibility, local SEO, and how trustworthy your website appears to visitors. We offer all major TLDs so you can select the perfect extension for your online presence.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-cyan-card\">\n                    <h4>\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>\n                        Brand Protection Tip\n                    </h4>\n                    <p>Register both the .co.nz and the .com variation of your business name. This prevents competitors or cybersquatters from acquiring a variation that matches your domain and confusing your customers. It is a low-cost insurance policy that every serious NZ business should consider.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"whnzd2-s1-right whnzd2-animate\">\n                <h3>Mini-Guide: How to Choose the Right Domain Extension in NZ</h3>\n                <ul class=\"whnzd2-num-list\">\n                    <li>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-circle\">1</div>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-content\">\n                            <strong>Choose .co.nz</strong>\n                            <span>If your business is based in New Zealand and primarily serves a local audience. Strong local SEO signal.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-circle\">2</div>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-content\">\n                            <strong>Choose .com</strong>\n                            <span>If you plan to operate internationally or want a globally recognised address. No geographic restriction.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-circle\">3</div>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-content\">\n                            <strong>Choose .org</strong>\n                            <span>If you run a non-profit, charity, or community group. Trustworthy and recognised worldwide.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-circle\">4</div>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-content\">\n                            <strong>Choose .nz</strong>\n                            <span>For a shorter, modern New Zealand domain \u2014 ideal if the .co.nz variation is taken.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-circle\">5</div>\n                        <div class=\"whnzd2-num-content\">\n                            <strong>Choose .info</strong>\n                            <span>For a low-cost domain if you are building a blog or informational website with a tight budget.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnzd2-container\">\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-center-head whnzd2-animate\">\n                <h2>Register, Transfer and Renew Your Domain Name</h2>\n                <p>Webhosting.co.nz is an accredited domain registrar with full DNS control, a clean management dashboard, and transparent pricing.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"whnzd2-grid-3 whnzd2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-action-card\">\n                    <h3>Register a Domain</h3>\n                    <p>Get your domain name in minutes. Search for your new domain, select the right extension, and complete your order through our secure checkout.</p>\n                    <ul class=\"whnzd2-checklist\">\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Full DNS control</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Free 10GB mailbox</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Clean dashboard</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Transparent pricing</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <a href=\"#domain\" class=\"whnzd2-btn whnzd2-btn-cyan\">REGISTER A DOMAIN</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-action-card\">\n                    <h3>Transfer Your Domain</h3>\n                    <p>Moving your domain to us is straightforward. Enter your domain name, provide the authorisation (EPP) code, and we handle the rest.</p>\n                    <ul class=\"whnzd2-checklist\">\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Same transparent price</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Full DNS management</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Local NZ support</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Privacy protection</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <a href=\"https://my.webhosting.co.nz/cart.php?a=add&domain=transfer\" class=\"whnzd2-btn whnzd2-btn-outline\">TRANSFER DOMAIN TO US</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-action-card\">\n                    <h3>Renew Your Domain</h3>\n                    <p>Never let your domain expire. Our renewal reminders notify you well in advance, and our transparent price means no surprise increases.</p>\n                    <ul class=\"whnzd2-checklist\">\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Renewal reminders</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> No surprise fees</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Bulk renewal options</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> 1-click renewal</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <a href=\"https://my.webhosting.co.nz/login\" class=\"whnzd2-btn whnzd2-btn-cyan\">RENEW YOUR DOMAIN</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnzd2-container whnzd2-grid-2\">\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-s3-left whnzd2-animate\">\n                <h2>Host Your Domain with Confidence</h2>\n                <p style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">Buying a domain is just the beginning. Webhosting.co.nz provides everything you need to build a fast, secure website and keep it performing at its best for every visitor \u2014 from free SSL to Cloudflare-powered infrastructure.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-row\">\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path></svg></div>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-text\">\n                        <h4>Free SSL Certificate</h4>\n                        <p>HTTPS protects your visitors, secures your data, and is a confirmed Google ranking factor. Activate it in one click from your dashboard.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-row\">\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-text\">\n                        <h4>Cloudflare Integration</h4>\n                        <p>Global CDN performance, faster load times, and reliable DNS management built for scale. Better page speed means better Google rankings.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-row\">\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-feature-text\">\n                        <h4>DDoS Protection</h4>\n                        <p>All domains and hosted websites benefit from enterprise-grade DDoS protection through Cloudflare's global network. No extra cost.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-s3-right whnzd2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-cyan-card\" style=\"height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;\">\n                    <h3 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Domain Privacy Protection</h3>\n                    <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); margin-bottom: 10px;\">When you register a domain, your personal contact details are added to the public WHOIS database by default. Our privacy protection service masks your personal information, replacing it with generic registrar details.</p>\n                    \n                    <ul class=\"whnzd2-cyan-card-checklist\">\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Keeps data out of spam lists</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Protects from unwanted solicitation</li>\n                        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg> Does not affect domain function</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnzd2-container\">\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-center-head whnzd2-animate\">\n                <h2>Professional Email and Business Tools</h2>\n                <p>A domain name paired with a professional email address and the right business tools builds the credibility your brand deserves.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"whnzd2-grid-2 whnzd2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-tool-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-tool-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z\"></path><polyline points=\"22,6 12,13 2,6\"></polyline></svg></div>\n                    <h3>Professional Email Address</h3>\n                    <p>Create a professional email address that matches your domain (for example: hello@yourbusiness.co.nz). Every domain you register includes a free, full-featured 10GB mailbox you can use on any device. Upgrade to branded email accounts at no extra cost.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#hosting-plans\" class=\"whnzd2-text-link\">Free 10GB Mailbox Included <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-tool-card\">\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-tool-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div>\n                    <h3>Marketing Tools Add-On</h3>\n                    <p>Extend your online presence with our suite of marketing tools. From campaign tracking to landing page tools, our add-on options are designed to help small and growing businesses in New Zealand compete online without enterprise-level complexity or cost.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#hosting-plans\" class=\"whnzd2-text-link\">Explore Marketing Suite <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-bottom-banner whnzd2-animate\">\n                <h3>Build Business Credibility Online</h3>\n                <p>A memorable domain name, a matching professional email address, and a fast secure website are the three pillars of a credible internet presence. We provide all three in one place, managed from a single dashboard.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnzd2-container\">\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-center-head whnzd2-animate\">\n                <h2>Low-Cost Domains, High Value Features</h2>\n                <p>Don't get caught out by deceptive first-year deals that lock you into high renewal fees.</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-feat-grid whnzd2-animate\">\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feat-box\">\n                    <h4>NZ-Based Provider</h4>\n                    <p>We are a New Zealand-based domain registrar. Our support team is local \u2014 you speak to someone who understands the NZ market.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feat-box\">\n                    <h4>Affordable & Transparent</h4>\n                    <p>Our pricing is clear and upfront. The price you see at checkout is the price you pay for renewal going forward.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feat-box\">\n                    <h4>Easy Dashboard</h4>\n                    <p>Manage every domain name, DNS record, SSL certificate, and email account from a single user-friendly dashboard.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feat-box\">\n                    <h4>Full DNS Control</h4>\n                    <p>Manage A records, CNAME, TXT, MX, and SRV. Our nameservers use Google's reliable global network.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feat-box\">\n                    <h4>Reliable Infrastructure</h4>\n                    <p>Powered by Cloudflare, giving every domain enterprise-grade speed, security, and DDoS protection.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"whnzd2-feat-box\">\n                    <h4>Real Support Team</h4>\n                    <p>Our friendly support team is available via live chat and email to help you get online and stay online.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnzd2-cta-banner whnzd2-animate\">\n            <h2>Own Your Perfect Domain Name Today</h2>\n            <p>A great domain name is the foundation of every successful website and business. A memorable domain name tells your customers exactly who you are, builds trust before they even arrive on your site, and gives your brand a home on the internet that you own \u2014 not rent.</p>\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-cta-buttons\">\n                <a href=\"#domain\" class=\"whnzd2-btn whnzd2-btn-white\">BUY A DOMAIN</a>\n                <a href=\"/web-hosting\" class=\"whnzd2-btn whnzd2-btn-white\">BUY HOSTING</a>\n                <a href=\"https://my.webhosting.co.nz/cart.php?a=add&domain=transfer\" class=\"whnzd2-btn whnzd2-btn-outline-white\">TRANSFER DOMAIN TO US</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"whnzd2-container\">\n            <div class=\"whnzd2-center-head whnzd2-animate\">\n                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Domain Registration in New Zealand</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"whnzd2-faq-wrap whnzd2-animate\">\n                <details class=\"whnzd2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg> How do I register a domain name in New Zealand?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-faq-content\">\n                        Use the domain search tool on Webhosting.co.nz to check availability for your chosen name. Select your preferred extension \u2014 .co.nz, .com, .org, or any other top-level domain \u2014 then add it to your cart and complete the secure checkout. Your new domain activates instantly. You will have full DNS control from your management dashboard straight away, and your free 10GB mailbox is ready to use immediately.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnzd2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg> What is the difference between .co.nz and .com?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-faq-content\">\n                        A .co.nz domain tells visitors and search engines that your business is based in New Zealand. This can improve local search visibility and build trust with a Kiwi audience who recognise the .co.nz extension as New Zealand's primary business domain. A .com extension has global recognition and no geographic restriction, making it ideal for businesses targeting customers outside New Zealand or those who want a universally familiar address. For most NZ businesses, we recommend registering both the .co.nz and the .com variation to protect your brand.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnzd2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg> Can I transfer my existing domain to Webhosting.co.nz?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-faq-content\">\n                        Yes. We accept domain transfers from all major registrars. To transfer your domain to us, enter your domain name in the transfer form, provide the authorisation (EPP) code from your current registrar, and complete the secure checkout. Transfers typically complete within 24\u201348 hours. Your website and email service experience no downtime during the transfer process. The transfer price is the same as the registration price \u2014 no hidden fees.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnzd2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg> What is included with every domain registration at Webhosting.co.nz?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-faq-content\">\n                        Every domain registered with Webhosting.co.nz includes a free 10GB full-featured mailbox, full DNS control (A, CNAME, MX, TXT, SRV records), access to your domain management dashboard, transparent renewal pricing, and privacy management tools. Hosted domains also include a free SSL certificate and Cloudflare integration for speed and DDoS protection.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnzd2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg> How much does it cost to renew a domain in New Zealand?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-faq-content\">\n                        Renewal prices at Webhosting.co.nz are the same as registration prices \u2014 there are no first-year promotional deals that jump on renewal. A .co.nz domain renews for NZ$33.00/yr, .com for NZ$19.99/yr, .org for NZ$18.99/yr, and .info for NZ$4.99/yr. You can view the full list of renew prices in the pricing table on this page.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n\n                <details class=\"whnzd2-faq-item\">\n                    <summary><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg> Do I need a New Zealand address to register a .co.nz domain name?</summary>\n                    <div class=\"whnzd2-faq-content\">\n                        Yes. To register a .co.nz domain, the registrant must have a New Zealand address or a legitimate connection to New Zealand. This is a requirement set by the .nz registry. If you do not have a NZ address, you can register a .com, .org, .net, or .info domain instead \u2014 these have no geographic registration requirements.\n                    </div>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    \n    </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<footer data-elementor-type=\"footer\" data-elementor-id=\"4117\" class=\"elementor elementor-4117 elementor-location-footer\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-667e98d5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"667e98d5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61ea9967 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"61ea9967\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f5f9c87 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3f5f9c87\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b75fd91 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7b75fd91\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Build Your Website with Webhosting NZ</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\